senses.gloss:
फणिज्झक = फणिज्ज(क)
(1) a) MAJORANA HORTENSIS MOENCH. [Intern. Code] = ORIGANUM
MAJORANA LINN. (Bpn, p. 510; HB; KB 3, p. 1985-1986; MW;
PW; V 8, p. 39);
b) Dn, वर्ग 4, 52: = मरुबक = खरपत्र = जम्बीर;
Rn, वर्ग 10, 80: = मरुबक = खरपत्र = गन्धपत्र;
Ḍa. on Su. Sū. 38, 18: = मरुबक = तीक्ष्णगन्ध;
c) = मधुरजम्बीर (see जम्बीर) (Vśs);
(2) a) a species of Ocimum (Kav);
b) a kind of तुलसी with small leaves (Vśs);
c) fragrant तुलसी (Vśs);
(3) POGOSTEMON PARVIFLORUS BENTH. (V 6, p. 41);
(4) PIPER NIGRUM LINN. (HK: = मरिच, but मरिच is also a name
of MAJORANA HORTENSIS MOENCH.);
(5) = पलाश (Vśs).
